                "text": "Met with Iowa's new HHS Director Larry Johnson to discuss Healthy Hometowns, part of Iowa\u2019s $592 million Rural Health Transformation Plan to strengthen rural healthcare access and innovation.\n\nFrom expanding telehealth and behavioral care to recruiting and retaining top medical talent, this initiative will help ensure every Iowan, no matter where they live, can access high-quality healthcare close to home.",
